Notion-style avatar artwork
===========================

The avatar layers in parts.generated.ts are derived from the "Noto avatar"
illustration pack by Felix Wong, released under CC0 1.0 (public domain
dedication) — no rights reserved, no attribution required.

    Designer:  https://www.producthunt.com/@felix12777
    Pack:      https://abstractlab.gumroad.com/l/noto-avatar
    Licence:   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

They were vendored from the notion-avatar project by Mayandev (Phil Zou),
which is licensed under the MIT License:

    Project:   https://github.com/Mayandev/notion-avatar
    Licence:   https://github.com/Mayandev/notion-avatar/blob/main/LICENSE.md

Nothing is depended on at runtime: the layers are copied into this repo, so
there is no package to install and no service to call.

Only the `public/avatar/preview` layers are vendored, and the seasonal
`festival` pack is excluded. Regenerate with:

    node scripts/vendor-notion-avatar.mjs /path/to/notion-avatar
